WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:15.228
Hi there!

2
00:00:15.229 --> 00:00:18.328
Who are you?

3
00:00:18.329 --> 00:00:22.119
I'm a baboon.

4
00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:26.439
Baboons are large monkeys.

5
00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:29.182
Where do you live?

6
00:00:29.183 --> 00:00:33.174
We live in Africa and Arabia.

7
00:00:33.175 --> 00:00:37.098
We like forests and savannas.

8
00:00:37.099 --> 00:00:39.564
What do you eat?

9
00:00:39.565 --> 00:00:43.264
We eat plants and meat.

10
00:00:43.265 --> 00:00:46.990
We like fruit, insects, and bark.

11
00:00:46.991 --> 00:00:51.378
Sometimes we eat birds or even sheep.

12
00:00:51.379 --> 00:00:54.953
You climb trees, right?

13
00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:58.277
We usually stay on the ground.

14
00:00:58.278 --> 00:01:02.275
But we climb trees to watch for enemies.

15
00:01:02.276 --> 00:01:06.182
We also sleep in trees.

16
00:01:06.183 --> 00:01:10.477
You live in a big group!

17
00:01:10.478 --> 00:01:14.178
Most baboons live in groups.

18
00:01:14.179 --> 00:01:19.805
We talk to each other by making sounds.

19
00:01:19.806 --> 00:01:24.159
Do baboons help each other?

20
00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:28.845
We remove dirt and bugs from each other.

21
00:01:28.846 --> 00:01:31.017
This keeps us clean.

22
00:01:31.018 --> 00:01:34.452
Do you have any enemies?

23
00:01:34.453 --> 00:01:38.181
Yes! We have many enemies.

24
00:01:38.182 --> 00:01:42.702
Big cats like cheetahs and lions hunt us.

25
00:01:42.703 --> 00:01:48.453
So do people.

26
00:01:48.454 --> 00:01:52.344
I see some tasty bark.

27
00:01:52.345 --> 00:01:55.657
See you later.

28
00:01:55.658 --> 00:02:02.099
Bye-bye, Baboon!
